# libpinyin 2.10.3: CMake property value split by unquoted list expansion
id: E999
draft: true
contributor_id: 2501_91199785
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configuration
severity: 2
category: build-system, cmake
error_signature: "set_directory_properties Wrong number of arguments"
match_keywords: "set_directory_properties, ADDITIONAL_MAKE_CLEAN_FILES, semicolon list, Wrong number of arguments, libpinyin"
title: "CMake 属性值中的分号列表未加引号，导致 set_directory_properties 参数数量错误"
root_cause: "CMake 在未引用的变量展开时将分号列表拆成多个实参；set_directory_properties(PROPERTIES key value) 因而收到额外参数。"
affected_scope: "通过变量给 CMake 属性传入多个文件路径的项目，尤其是 ADDITIONAL_MAKE_CLEAN_FILES；不适用于属性名或参数本身拼写错误。"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "quote-the-complete-list-property-value"
rec_description: "保持列表元素不变，仅在传给 set_directory_properties 的属性值外加双引号；重新配置，确认该处错误消失，并继续检查后续配置及构建日志。"
rec_command: "set_directory_properties(PROPERTIES ADDITIONAL_MAKE_CLEAN_FILES \"${CLEAN_FILES}\")"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: "source-patch"
forbid_1_pattern: "set_directory_properties.*ADDITIONAL_MAKE_CLEAN_FILES.*REMOVE|set_directory_properties.*ADDITIONAL_MAKE_CLEAN_FILES.*OFF"
forbid_1_reason: "删除清理属性只能隐藏参数错误，会改变上游生成数据的清理行为。"
forbid_1_consequence: "增量或重建时可能残留旧数据。"
similar_to: "E409（空列表元素在 list(APPEND) 中丢失；本条是多值属性列表在 set_directory_properties 中扩成额外实参）"
doc_file: "knowledge/drafts/E999-draft-2501-91199785-libpinyin-cmake-property-list.md"
verification_cmd: "对比 libpinyin W3 031713Z 的 data/CMakeLists.txt:104 配置失败与修复后 042115Z 的完整 conan create、CTest 6/6 和消费者 7/7；验证日志 SHA-256 e21131a6c166851675c034f2db19f65ea2895b053eb86a9fe7d5666957a0b4f1"
last_updated: "2026-10-07"
source_event: "libpinyin 2.10.3 HarmonyOS PC 配方的 CMake 配置失败"
